+# FAA Somerset notification counterpart and Flight 93 alert versions
+
+November 9, 2026 Eastern · **TEL03–TEL04 / AUD016-A1**, with **B129** context. The FAA’s RG 237 copy of the Somerset notification form contains one page. Its handwritten time cells closely match the first page of the seven-page Team 8 packet. Two separate FAA alert bulletins preserve different date/time, departure and turn fields. Their publication history and operational source records remain open. [FAA finding aid, Boxes 96 and 98](https://www.archives.gov/research/foia/faa-finding-aid-96-107) · [Source pins and test matrix](SOURCE-PINS.json)
+
+## Scope of the Somerset form
+
+**AWA-575, NARA 7597141**, is one physical PDF page with a first-page embedded image of **828 × 1066** at 8 bits per component. The Commission packet has seven pages and its first-page embedded image is **2550 × 3509** at 1 bit per component. The separate PDFs have different hashes. Both faces show **UAL 93**, **9/11/01**, and the handwritten time cells read as **1451**, **1616** and **1507**. The Commission image shows overwriting in the first time cell. The lower row label remains uncertain. The AWA-575 form image reads **FAA Form 8020-3 (1-86)**. Its text layer reads **FAA Fonn 1020-3(1-$)**. [AWA-575 record](https://catalog.archives.gov/id/7597141) · [Commission packet comparison](https://github.com/AveLyra/911-conspiracy-investigation/blob/9699574f7bf65e15913064f6672ae89185b7e23c/investigation/broader-evidence/telephone-somerset-facility-notification-2026-11-09/README.md)
+
+A crop comparison rendered the two first pages at two grayscale pixels per PDF point. It compared each Commission time cell with each FAA cell using normalized cross-correlation, nine candidate isotropic scales and translations within the listed search boxes. The corresponding cells scored **0.875858**, **0.897422** and **0.831373**. The six noncorresponding cells scored **0.375607–0.493783**. The regions were selected after visual inspection. The agreement supports a shared form image. The FAA object leaves the Commission packet’s six companion pages outside its scope. The copy or transfer direction, upstream original, handwritten timebase and operational meaning remain unresolved. [Crop coordinates, scales and scores](SOURCE-PINS.json)
+
