+
+[AWA-857, catalog 7597204](https://catalog.archives.gov/id/7597204) · [AWA-858, catalog 7597205](https://catalog.archives.gov/id/7597205)
+
+Both bulletins label their information preliminary. Keep the edition text, catalog ordering, alert time, reported events and chart headings separate. The later printed edition repeats **9:42am ET** in two fields, whereas the other bulletin assigns it to the reported departure. Its supersession wording leaves the actual send and receipt chronology open. The Commission final report separately gives an **8:42** takeoff and a **10:03:11** impact estimate. Those are a later account with its own source basis. The AWA fields remain preserved as printed. [Commission report, chapter 1](https://www.911commission.gov/report/911Report_Ch1.htm)
+
+## Open comparisons
+
+- Retrieve bulletin routing, distribution and revision records and the native source of the radar and ATC fields. Compare the actual inputs behind each field before using a bulletin to time a notice or operational event. The chart headings alone leave radar continuity and time alignment untested.
+- Obtain the county calls and recorder media, their dispatch and transfer identifiers, the trip sheet and the PEMA receiving record. The FAA form comparison establishes a source counterpart and leaves caller, device and transfer matching open. [County media and dispatch leads](https://github.com/AveLyra/911-conspiracy-investigation/blob/66049ad133af0f5262514965a623f1cffcfaec74/investigation/broader-evidence/telephone-shanksville-media-withdrawal-2026-11-09/README.md)
+- The B129 **PD01–PD04** targets retain separate acceptance criteria for the actual corrected QFR, receipt, signed administrative decision, recommendation outcomes and policy.
+
+The three archive bodies were acquired through their item-level metadata. Verification checked three catalog IDs and object links, the catalog and PDF hashes, **19** fixed PDF text anchors across **six** new pages, selected visual fields, and the nine crop comparisons. No radar plot values, recorded calls, receipt times or personnel outcomes were measured. [Verification scope](SOURCE-PINS.json)
